 <h3><u>Khoon-e-hussain</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye mazloom Hussain, Mera mazloom Hussain *2<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2<br> Ab hashr tak lahoo ko na muh se chhudaungi,<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2</p> 
  <p>1- Haq se kahungi Fatima faryad layi hai,<br> Ummat ne mere laal ko mara duhai hai,<br> Nauha yahi mai hashr me padhti hi jaungi,<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2</p> 
  <p>2- Paani dikha dikha ke rulaya Hussain ko,<br> Nazron ke mere samne mara Hussain ko,<br> Roro ke apne laal pe sabko rulaungi.<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2</p> 
  <p>3- Karte raho aye momino matam Hussain ka<br> Tum sab ke kaam ayega ye gham Hussain ka<br> Wada hai Fatima ka tumhe bakhshwaungi.<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2</p> 
  <p>4- Bacchon ke mere khoon se tar hai meri rida,<br> Khanjar se haye mera bhi zakhmi hua gala,<br> Ashkon ke badle aankh se main khoon bahaungi.<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2</p> 
  <p>5- Dasht-e-bala ki Bekasi us dil ke chain ki,<br> Hogi bapa jo hashr me majlis Hussain ki,<br> Jo bhi hue wo sare masayab sunaungi.<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2</p> 
  <p>6- Ab qabr me na chain se soyegi Fatima,<br> Jangal me apne laal pe royegi Fatima,<br> Hogi jahan pe majlis-e-shabbeer jaungi,<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2</p> 
  <p>7- Pehlu shikasta bibi ye kehti hai baar baar,<br> Jo majlis-e-Hussain me rota hai zar zar,<br> Unko liye baghair na Jannat me jaungi.<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2</p> 
  <p>8- Aamir bataun kese mere dil ke chain ko,<br> Meri nazar ke samne mara Hussain ko,<br> Aalam ye nauha hashr me padhti main jaungi.<br> Khoone-e-hussain jake khuda ko dikhaungi *2<br> Haye mazloom Hussain, Mera mazloom Hussain *2</p> 
